          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>The Fast&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;29</li>\n<li>Expended: bread and transport</li>\n<li>11 3/4</li>\n<li>Bu'l-Majd //4// his (maternal) uncle Yosef M[...]</li>\n<li>1</li>\n<li>Y\u016bsuf ben \u02bfAw\u0101\u1e0d and his travelling companion for travel</li>\n<li>2 1/6</li>\n<li>balance: 9 3/4</li>\n<li>mezonot 39</li>\n<li>total</li>\n<li>48 3/4</li>\n<li>&ndash;13. bread 17 3/4&nbsp; R. Yedutun 1 R. Yifta\u1e25 6 1/2</li>\n<li></li>\n<li>&ndash;15. the ritual cleaner 6 beadles of the synagogue 6 ritual cleaners 3</li>\n<li></li>\n<li>(our) ma(ster) and t(eacher)</li>\n<li>[6] copper 1/2</li>\n<li>balance</li>\n<li>2</li></ol>\n",
